# GeoAgent-Lebanon -- environment variables (all optional; the tool layer and
# tests run fine with none of these set, since it is stdlib-only and reads
# only local files under outputs/eval/).

# Path to the tool-call audit log written by every MCP/CLI call.
# Leave unset for the default (outputs/agent_tool_audit_log.jsonl under the repo root).
# Set to an empty string to disable audit logging entirely (used by the test suite).
GEOAGENT_AUDIT_LOG=

# No API keys are required to run the tool layer, the CLI, or the tests: they
# never call an LLM themselves. An API key is only needed on the client side,
# to run an MCP-capable assistant (e.g. Claude Desktop) that connects to this
# server -- that key is configured in the client, not here.
